  clock: 9  # 2552
  nonce: '2552'  # 2552
  message: "Done — merged PR #643 (5a7b0f5a0c), ADR-0042 S2-CLI. `hypergumbo survey` is the primary verb producing survey.json; `run` is a deprecated stderr-warning alias. BEHAVIORAL REPRO (live, XDG-scoped cache): `hypergumbo survey <repo>` -> exit 0, writes survey.json (0 legacy files, no warning); `hypergumbo run <repo>` -> exit 0 + stderr \"warning: 'hypergumbo run' is deprecated and will be removed in a future release; use 'hypergumbo survey' instead.\" Default write + INV-somup by-name filter, 3 cache-readers (_peek_cached_results / sketch auto-discover / find_latest_behavior_map), cmd_sketch artifact glob (_glob_survey_artifacts), discovery DEFAULT_EXCLUDES, and sketch ADDITIONAL_FILES_EXCLUDES all moved to survey*.json; legacy hypergumbo.results*.json still resolved on read. The rename surfaced + this PR fixed a cold-cache reload NPE in generate_sketch, an artifact-glob under-report, and a walk-exclude gap (all caught by the coverage gate). 11062 tests / 100% coverage on changed files. Removal of the run alias + legacy filename aliases at window-close is a separate follow-up (does not gate this)."  # 2552
